-  onfocus     the element got the focus
-  onblur      the element lost the focus
--->
-<!ENTITY % focus
- "accesskey   %Character;    #IMPLIED
-  tabindex    %Number;       #IMPLIED
-  onfocus     %Script;       #IMPLIED
